 kit audit - lists the forge's attestations, alerts, controls, waivers, the policy, and what binds

   one of
   *kit audit*    lists the forge's attestations, alerts, controls, waivers, the policy, and what
                binds

     --text   --json   --jq
                           prints the stages as text, even on a terminal

   --stages     prints the stages, one per line, in order, the same over any workspace
   --marks      prints a mark per stage, as one JSON object: evidence's moves with the forge's runs
                and releases, findings' with its runs and alerts, each scanner's off or refused
                where it is, policy's with kit.yml and .kit/policy, enforcement's with the files its
                local rows read; controls and waivers have none, null, as each is read again only on
                Refresh, kittui offering no Watch for them
   evidence     the attestations of the 5 newest releases' assets and the 20 newest artifacts
   findings     the code scanning, Dependabot, and secret scanning alerts, open and dismissed
   controls     the rulesets and the protection that guard the default branch
   waivers      who may bypass each control, and each alert dismissed
   policy       each rule kit policy judges by, as kit policy --rules lists them
   enforcement  what binds an agent and what is advice, per harness and for the repository, in four
                tiers


 kit audit
